    "actual_commit_message": "Merge qualified PatchTrace consolidation (#349) [no release] [no deploy]\n\n[no release] [no deploy]\n\nPromote reviewed source ae69f1e65d7c4564ec5b0e6d7a80119193fabc4e, complete tree c3f09435deb99ca0ddb3406e27ab315dba7740cf. All eight applicable exact-source workflows completed successfully; 30 applicable jobs passed and four intentionally inapplicable jobs were skipped. Tested synthetic merge 66f153a8372ad93c72e2f5b10365dcf210681684 has parents fdc2696c23bdbfe7668348f25e3b336ce33039f7 and ae69f1e65d7c4564ec5b0e6d7a80119193fabc4e.\n\nLinux full suite: 24,190 passed, 53 skipped, 3 expected failures. Windows full suite: 24,059 passed, 185 skipped, 2 expected failures. Whole-tree Ruff, Qt repetition, actual Windows standalone/portable/installer/uninstall, and Ubuntu 22.04/24.04 frozen smoke checks passed. Native and packaging qualification details and independent reviews are preserved in PR #349 and source-specific evidence. Sealed primary evidence SHA256: 8eb127426bcf216b840bc10d5243fccdb8964d4ba17bf53b6282920406b57859.\n\nThis merge preserves the broader CODEX-5, Tier R/Tier W native, manual accessibility/trust/provenance, and L1/L2/L3 acceptance gates. It does not authorize a release, tag, Pages deployment, or deletion of historical branches.",
